      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$t$ 是运动经过的时间。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "任意取变量 $v$ 的两个值，设 $v_1=5,v_2=6$，那么变量 $t$ 对",
        "应的值是 $t_1=24,t_2=20$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "求 $\\frac{v_1}{v_2}$ 和 $\\frac{t_1}{t_2}$ 的商：",
        "$\\frac{v_1}{v_2}=\\frac{5}{6},\\quad\\frac{t_1}{t_2}=\\frac{24}{20}=\\frac{6}{5}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "容易看出，$\\frac{v_1}{v_2}$ 的商等于 $\\frac{t_1}{t_2}$ 的商的倒数。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果另外取变量 $v$ 的一对值，不妨取 $v_3=15,v_4=20$，我",
        "们还会得到同样的结论。这时得到 $t_3=8,t_4=6$。",
        "$\\frac{v_3}{v_4}=\\frac{15}{20}=\\frac{3}{4},\\quad\\frac{t_3}{t_4}=\\frac{8}{6}=\\frac{4}{3}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这里 $\\frac{v_3}{v_4}$ 的商同样等于 $\\frac{t_3}{t_4}$ 的商的倒数，即等于商 $\\frac{t_4}{t_3}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一般地，如果函数 $x\\xrightarrow{f}y$ 是反比例函数，$(x_1,y_1)$ 和 $(x_2,$",
        "$y_2)$ 是变量 $x$ 和 $y$ 的对应值数对，那么",
        "$\\frac{x_1}{x_2}=\\frac{y_2}{y_1}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "下面我们给出证明。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "从式 $y=\\frac{k}{x}$ 得到：$y_1=\\frac{k}{x_1},\\ y_2=\\frac{k}{x_2}$，其中 $y_1\\ne0,y_2\\ne0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，$\\frac{y_2}{y_1}=\\frac{\\frac{k}{x_2}}{\\frac{k}{x_1}}=\\frac{k}{x_2}\\cdot\\frac{x_1}{k}=\\frac{x_1}{x_2}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果变量 $x$ 和 $y$ 的值是正数，那么上面证明的反比例函"
      ]
    },
